            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing the aggro strategy with two Partner WB commanders, Prava of the Steel Legion and Tevesh Szat, Doom of Fools. The key concept revolves around generating a wide board presence with tokens and low-cost creatures while disrupting the opponent's game plan with targeted removal spells and hand disruption. The deck aims to overwhelm the opponent with efficient creatures like Bitterblossom, Hero of Bladehold, and Monastery Mentor, supported by cards like Elspeth, Sun's Champion, Gideon, Ally of Zendikar, and Sorin, Solemn Visitor. Additionally, the deck includes powerful disruption tools like Thoughtseize, Inquisition of Kozilek, and Balance to control the board and maintain pressure on the opponent."
